{%- comment -%}
  MUTO Home — product structured data.

  The home page sells a product, so it should say which one in a form an answer
  engine can resolve. Everything here is read from the live product — title,
  description, image, SKU, price, availability — so it cannot drift from what
  the store actually offers, and there is nothing to keep in sync by hand.

  The @id is the product's own URL, not this page's, so this merges with the
  markup the product template emits rather than competing with it, and `brand`
  points at the same Organization node the page's other JSON-LD declares.

  One Offer per variant rather than an AggregateOffer: the three plans are
  genuinely different prices with their own SKUs, and naming them lets an
  answer engine quote the right one.

  Emitted inline from Liquid; there is deliberately no .json in assets/.

  Accepts: product, page_url.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign org_id = shop.url | append: '/#organization'
  assign prod_url = shop.url | append: product.url
  assign prod_id = prod_url | append: '#product'
  assign summary = product.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 320
  assign img = product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200
-%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Product",
  "@id": {{ prod_id | json }},
  "name": {{ product.title | json }},
  "url": {{ prod_url | json }},
  "description": {{ summary | json }}{% if img %},
  "image": {{ img | prepend: 'https:' | replace: 'https:https:', 'https:' | json }}{% endif %}{% if product.vendor != blank %},
  "brand": { "@type": "Brand", "name": {{ product.vendor | json }}, "@id": {{ org_id | json }} }{% endif %},
  "offers": [
    {%- for v in product.variants -%}
      {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "name": {{ v.title | json }},
        "url": {{ prod_url | append: '?variant=' | append: v.id | json }},
        "price": {{ v.price | divided_by: 100.0 | json }},
        "priceCurrency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
        "availability": {% if v.available %}"https://schema.org/InStock"{% else %}"https://schema.org/OutOfStock"{% endif %}{% if v.sku != blank %},
        "sku": {{ v.sku | json }}{% endif %}
      }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
</script>
